---
title: "Sequence Diagram - Become a Seller and Publish a Story"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Parent (Seller)
  actor SP as Specialist
  participant W as Web App
  participant R as :Sellers / Listings / ModerationRoutes
  participant C as :PublishingController
  participant PS as :PublishingService
  participant PR as :PublishRules
  participant NS as :StoriesNarrationService
  participant NST as :StoriesNarrationStore
  participant DB as Database

  Note over U,DB: 1. Apply to become a seller
  U->>W: Fill seller profile (display name, bio, expertise)
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/sellers/apply
  R->>C: applySeller(req, res)
  C->>PS: applySeller(user, body)
  PS->>DB: SELECT active subscription + plan, seller_profiles
  alt plan cannot sell
    PS-->>C: ApiError 422
    C-->>W: 422 Upgrade plan to sell stories
  else already pending / approved / suspended
    PS-->>C: ApiError 409 / 403
    C-->>W: 409 / 403 error
  else ok (new or previously rejected)
    PS->>DB: UPSERT seller_profiles (pending)
    C-->>W: 201 seller profile (pending)
  end

  Note over U,DB: 2. Specialist approves the seller
  SP->>W: Open seller applications
  W->>R: GET /api/v1/moderation/sellers?status=pending
  R->>C: listSellerApplications(req, res)
  C-->>W: 200 pending profiles
  SP->>W: Approve or reject
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/moderation/sellers/:userId/decision {approve}
  R->>C: decideSeller(req, res)
  C->>PS: decideSeller(moderator, userId, body)
  PS->>DB: UPDATE seller_profiles SET approved / rejected (only if pending)
  alt no pending profile
    PS-->>C: ApiError 404
    C-->>W: 404 error
  else updated
    C-->>W: 200 seller profile
  end

  Note over U,DB: 3. Publish a story (new listing or new version of a live listing)
  U->>W: Pick a finished story, set title, price, character aliases
  alt new listing
    W->>R: POST /api/v1/listings {storyId, title, priceVnd, aliases}
    R->>C: createListing(req, res)
    C->>PS: createListing(user, body)
  else new version of a published listing
    W->>R: POST /api/v1/listings/:listingId/versions {title, priceVnd, aliases}
    R->>C: createListingVersion(req, res)
    C->>PS: createListingVersion(user, listingId, body)
    PS->>DB: SELECT live listing, pending version
    alt not published / a version is already pending
      PS-->>C: ApiError 409
      C-->>W: 409 error
    end
    PS->>PS: createListing(user, body, previousListingId)
  end
  PS->>DB: SELECT seller_profiles, active plan
  PS->>PR: validPriceVnd(priceVnd)
  alt seller not approved / plan cannot sell / invalid price
    PS-->>C: ApiError 403 / 422 / 422
    C-->>W: error
  else ok
    PS->>DB: SELECT private story with pages, checkpoints, characters
    PS->>PR: findReviewGaps, aliasErrors, leftoverNameErrors
    alt story not reviewed / has gaps / real family name left
      PS-->>C: ApiError 422 (details)
      C-->>W: 422 Remove personal info / finish the story
    else ok
      PS->>DB: BEGIN, copy story as kind published (aliases, scenes, pages, checkpoints, options)
      PS->>DB: INSERT listings (submitted, priceVnd, previousListingId), INSERT moderation_reviews (submission)
      opt new version with narration
        PS->>NST: reuseNarration(copy, live story, voice)
        NST->>DB: copy ready clips whose fingerprint did not change
      end
      PS->>NS: prepareNarration(tx, copyId)
      NS->>DB: queue narration clips for remaining segments
      PS->>DB: COMMIT
      PS->>NS: dispatchNarration(jobs) (see 3.3a)
      PS-->>C: listing + narration progress
      C-->>W: 201 listing submitted
      W-->>U: Waiting for moderation
    end
  end
